# Computed home grid (task 014 P1c) with a realistic app list at the sizes that are not pinned presets. The pinned
# sizes (640x480, 480x320) are not rendered here: they have goldens and home/home_status cover them. 1024x600 runs
# at its real 6.6 px/mm (7" panel).
title home grid
sizes 800x480 720x720 1280x720 1024x600
@1024x600 ppmm 660
apps Settings Store CLI Python SSH "IP Panel" Calculator Snake Tank Mesh 2048=fixture:2048_128.png Browser
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
shot home_grid
key DOWN
key DOWN
key RIGHT
shot home_grid_focus
key DOWN
key DOWN
shot home_grid_scrolled
metrics home_grid_metrics
